  "historyNote": "#5341, eff 3-3-92; EXPIRED: 3-3-98 New. #6741, eff 4-28-98, EXPIRED: 4-28-06; ss by #8602, INTERIM, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRES: 10-25-06; ss by #8685, eff 7-21-06; amd and renumbered by #9206, eff 7-19-08 (former paragraph (a) deleted) (formerly He-W 403.04); ss by #10467, eff 11-26-13; ss by #10760, eff 1-19-15; ss by #14275, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
